---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About HEX Design Labs" description="Learn about HEX Design Labs, a Scottsdale web design and website management studio helping small businesses build practical, professional websites.">
	<main class="page">
		<section class="page-hero">
			<p class="eyebrow">About HEX</p>
			<h1>Design support for businesses that need websites handled with care.</h1>
			<p class="lead">
				HEX Design Labs helps small businesses turn scattered website needs into clear, useful digital systems: sharp pages, sensible structure, and ongoing support after launch.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section class="section two-column">
			<div>
				<h2>Built for practical momentum.</h2>
				<p>
					We focus on websites that are easy to understand, easy to maintain, and strong enough to represent the business behind them. The work blends brand thinking, web design, copy structure, and reliable technical execution.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="card accent-card">
				<h3>What guides the work</h3>
				<p>Clear messaging, responsive layouts, dependable maintenance, and a low-drama process that keeps decisions moving.</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="section">
			<p class="eyebrow">How We Work</p>
			<h2>Simple process, useful outcomes.</h2>
			<div class="grid">
				<article class="card">
					<h3>Clarify</h3>
					<p>We define the goal, audience, content needs, and practical constraints before design starts.</p>
				</article>
				<article class="card">
					<h3>Create</h3>
					<p>We design and build pages that feel credible, load cleanly, and guide visitors toward action.</p>
				</article>
				<article class="card">
					<h3>Maintain</h3>
					<p>We support updates, improvements, and site care so the website keeps working after launch.</p>
				</article>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>
